---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing"
  description="mdbase Connect plans: Free, with a 30-day storage trial, and Plus for US$10 a month or US$96 a year."
  current="pricing"
>
  <header class="page-intro split pricing-intro">
    <div class="split__text">
      <h1>Pricing</h1>
      <p class="page-intro__lede">
        Every Connect account starts on Free. Plus adds storage, collections and
        people for US$10 a month or US$96 a year.
      </p>
      <p>
        Notes don’t count towards storage. Only uploaded files do, such as PDFs,
        images and other attachments.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="plan-grid">
      <article class="plan" aria-labelledby="plan-free">
        <h2 id="plan-free">Free</h2>
        <p class="plan__price">US$0</p>
        <p class="plan__terms">With 5 GB of storage for your first 30 days</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span>Storage for uploaded files</span> <strong>250 MB</strong></li>
          <li><span>Synced collections</span> <strong>1</strong></li>
          <li><span>People you can share each collection with</span> <strong>1</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="button" href="https://connect.mdbase.dev/signup">Sign up</a>
      </article>
      <article class="plan plan--plus" aria-labelledby="plan-plus">
        <h2 id="plan-plus">Plus</h2>
        <p class="plan__price">US$10 <span>a month</span></p>
        <p class="plan__terms">Or US$96 a year, which is US$8 a month</p>
        <ul>
          <li><span>Storage for uploaded files</span> <strong>100 GB</strong></li>
          <li><span>Synced collections</span> <strong>10</strong></li>
          <li><span>People you can share each collection with</span> <strong>5</strong></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="button button--primary" href="https://connect.mdbase.dev/account">Upgrade an account</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </header>

  <div class="detail-grid">
  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="paying">
    <h2 id="paying">Paying for Plus</h2>
    <p>
      Upgrade from your <a href="https://connect.mdbase.dev/account">account page</a>.
      Plus is sold through Link, Stripe’s checkout service, which acts as the
      seller. Checkout shows the price in your local currency, with any sales
      tax, VAT or GST, before you pay. Link sends your receipts, and your card
      statement shows <code>LINK.COM* MDBASE</code>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Plus renews automatically at the end of each month or year. Cancel or
      switch between monthly and yearly with <strong>Manage billing</strong> on
      your account page. When you cancel, Plus continues until the end of the
      period you’ve paid for.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="ending">
    <h2 id="ending">When Plus or the trial ends</h2>
    <p>
      Your account returns to Free’s limits. Nothing is deleted: your
      collections and files stay where they are and keep syncing. If you’re over
      a limit, you can’t upload new files or add collections until you’re back
      under it.
    </p>
    <p>
      If a renewal payment fails, Plus continues for a week while you update
      your payment method.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="refunds">
    <h2 id="refunds">Refunds</h2>
    <p>
      If Plus isn’t right for you, email
      <a href="mailto:support@mdbase.dev">support@mdbase.dev</a> within 14 days
      of a payment and we’ll refund it. You can also ask
      <a href="https://support.link.com/topics/sold-through-link">Link support</a>.
      The <a href="/terms/#refunds">terms</a> have the details.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="content-section" aria-labelledby="beta-accounts">
    <h2 id="beta-accounts">Beta accounts</h2>
    <p>
      Accounts created during the beta keep their beta allowance. Connect is
      still in beta, and Plus doesn’t add an availability guarantee. Keep
      independent backups of important collections.
    </p>
  </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
